Controller <|-- AuthController : handles authentication
Controller <|-- CompanyProfileController : maintains profile
Controller <|-- CompanyMemberController : maintains membership
Controller <|-- TenderSearchController : searches tenders
Controller <|-- WatchlistController : manages watchlist
Controller <|-- ChatController : accepts agent questions
Controller <|-- NotificationController : manages notifications
Controller <|-- StatisticsController : presents statistics
User --|> Authenticatable : extends Laravel auth model

AuthController ..> AuthService : delegates
AuthService ..> User : authenticates and creates
AuthService ..> IdentityProviderPort : verifies identity
IdentityProviderAdapter ..|> IdentityProviderPort : implements
AuthService ..> AuthSession : establishes session
IdentityProviderAdapter ..> ExternalIdentity : returns verified identity

ContractorOrganization "1" *-- "1" CompanyProfile : owns
ContractorOrganization "1" *-- "0..*" Membership : has members
User "1" -- "0..*" Membership : participates through
CompanyProfileController ..> CompanyManagementService : delegates
CompanyMemberController ..> CompanyManagementService : delegates
CompanyManagementService ..> ContractorOrganization : scopes changes to
CompanyManagementService ..> CompanyProfile : reads and updates
CompanyManagementService ..> Membership : lists and changes
ContractorAdminService ..> ContractorOrganization : manages
AccountManagementService ..> User : enables or disables

TenderSearchController ..> TenderSearchService : delegates
TenderSearchService ..> TenderSearchClient : retrieves portal data
TenderSearchClient ..> TenderClientOptions : configures requests
TenderSearchClient ..> APIRequestContext : sends HTTP requests
TenderSearchClient ..> CategorySearchResponse : parses categories
TenderSearchClient ..> AreaSearchResponse : parses areas
TenderSearchClient ..> PopularKeywordResponse : parses popular keywords
TenderSearchService ..> SearchRequest : builds query
TenderSearchService ..> SearchResponse : parses response
SearchRequest "1" *-- "1..*" SearchClauseSchema : contains
SearchClauseSchema "1" *-- "0..*" SearchFilterSchema : contains
SearchResponse "1" *-- "1" SearchPageSchema : contains
SearchPageSchema "1" *-- "0..*" TenderSummary : returns
TenderSummary "1" *-- "0..*" TenderLocationSchema : includes
CategorySearchResponse "1" *-- "0..*" CategoryOptionSchema : contains
AreaSearchResponse "1" *-- "0..*" AreaSchema : contains
PopularKeywordResponse "1" *-- "1" PopularKeywordPageSchema : contains
PopularKeywordPageSchema "1" *-- "0..*" PopularKeywordSchema : contains
NormalizedTender "0..*" --> "1" TenderSummary : normalizes source
TenderSearchService ..> TenderDetail : retrieves current detail
TenderSearchClient ..> ContractValidationError : rejects invalid contract
TenderSearchClient ..> ApiHttpError : reports HTTP failure
TenderSearchClient ..> RequestBudgetError : enforces request limit
ContractValidationError --|> Error : extends
ApiHttpError --|> Error : extends
RequestBudgetError --|> Error : extends

BidAnalysisService ..> TenderSummary : evaluates
BidAnalysisService ..> CompanyProfile : uses authorized context
BidAnalysisService ..> AgentRuntime : requests advisory analysis
BidAnalysisService ..> BidAnalysisResult : returns
BidAnalysisService ..> EvaluationJob : starts evaluation
BidAnalysisResult "1" *-- "0..*" AnalysisFinding : explains assessment
WatchlistController ..> WatchlistService : delegates
WatchlistService ..> WatchlistEntry : creates and lists references
WatchlistService ..> WatchlistRepository : persists references
PostgresWatchlistRepository ..|> WatchlistRepository : implements
WatchlistEntry ..> TenderSummary : resolves summary when displayed
WatchlistService ..> ContractorOrganization : scopes entries by tenant

ChatController ..> AgentConversationService : delegates
AgentConversationService ..> Conversation : maintains interaction
Conversation "1" *-- "0..*" ChatMessage : contains messages
AgentConversationService ..> AgentRuntime : processes question
AgentConversationService ..> CompanyProfile : reads authorized context
StreamGrantIssuer ..> StreamGrant : issues short-lived access
AgentStreamService ..> StreamGrant : validates scope and expiry
AgentStreamService ..> EvaluationJob : streams job progress
AgentStreamService ..> EventReplayStore : reads replay buffer
RedisEventReplayStore ..|> EventReplayStore : implements
EvaluationJob "1" -- "0..*" StreamEvent : emits progress events
AgentRuntime ..> EvaluationJob : executes
NotificationController ..> NotificationService : delegates
NotificationService ..> Notification : retrieves and deletes
NotificationService ..> ContractorOrganization : scopes access

AgentAdminService ..> AgentConfiguration : manages
AgentConfiguration "1" *-- "1" PromptConfiguration : contains
AgentConfiguration "1" *-- "1" PolicyConfiguration : contains
AgentConfiguration "1" *-- "1" ModelConfiguration : contains
StatisticsController ..> StatisticsService : delegates
StatisticsService ..> UserStatistics : aggregates users
StatisticsService ..> AgentStatistics : aggregates agent runs
StatisticsService ..> StatisticsFilter : applies period and scope
UserStatistics "0..*" *-- "1" StatisticsFilter : reports period
AgentStatistics "0..*" *-- "1" StatisticsFilter : reports period

